# Fix(linux): keep virtual Xbox controllers on hid-generic PR 192
# Fix for Xbox 360 controllers GUIDE+<some key> fails Issue 191
#
# Commented out failing doc changes

From ea46aa173e3edff6e471da62ff657bdac62957a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReenigneArcher <42013603+ReenigneArcher@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:15:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(linux): keep virtual Xbox controllers on hid-generic

Mark the upper word of the UHID vendor ID to prevent xpadneo and its udev rules from claiming virtual Xbox One and Series devices. Preserve the consumer-visible Xbox identity, Guide chords, trigger rumble, and battery reporting.

Add kernel identity assertions and SDL2/SDL3 Guide chord regression coverage. Validate with 144 unit tests and five native consumer tests with xpadneo Guide shift mode enabled.

Fixes #191
